{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB全新煮食選秀節目《星廚》宣傳片中，除了有爆紅新人吳敬浩，其拍檔、24歲的陳芷珊（Tracy）同樣來頭不小！樣貌甜美的她被揭是香港中文大學畢業生，不但精通五種語言，更擁有中國舞教師資格，其驚人的學霸及才女背景，絕對是美貌與智慧並重！\n</p>\n<h2>中大畢業精通五國語言 陳芷珊學霸背景嚇親網民</h2>\n<p>現年24歲的陳芷珊，畢業於本地著名學府香港中文大學，單是這項學歷已令不少人眼前一亮。更令人驚訝的是她的語言天賦，據悉她精通廣東話、普通話、英語、客家話及上海話共五種語言，溝通能力極強。在拍攝《星廚》宣傳片時，她以甜美外型彈結他賣萌，但鏡頭背後卻是個不折不扣的學霸，反差感極大。</p>\n<h2>陳芷珊舞功高強 2021年已考獲北京舞蹈學院教師資格</h2>\n<p>除了學業成績優異，陳芷珊的藝術造詣同樣出色。她自幼學習中國舞，舞蹈功底深厚，更早在2021年、年僅19歲時，已成功考獲北京舞蹈學院中國舞一至三年級的教師資格，可謂多才多藝。擁有專業舞蹈背景，難怪她在宣傳片中舉手投足都充滿氣質，鏡頭感十足，完美符合節目對「星味」的要求。</p>\n<h2>同為33期訓練班學員 陳芷珊曾參演《愛回家》多套劇集</h2>\n<p>陳芷珊與拍檔吳敬浩同為2024年第33期藝員訓練班的畢業生，入行後已獲得不少演出機會。她曾參演過多套TVB劇集，當中包括處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》、《愛．回家之三代同糖》以及《正義女神》等，雖然大多是小角色，但已為她累積了不少寶貴的幕前經驗，為日後的演藝事業打下基礎。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚才貌雙全：「TVB終於有高學歷靚女！」</h2>\n<p>陳芷珊的超強背景曝光後，引來網民熱議，不少人大讚她是「才貌雙全」的代表。網民紛紛留言：「又靚又叻女！中大畢業仲識五種語言，太屈機！」、「原來係舞蹈老師，唔怪得拍宣傳片咁有氣質。」、「TVB終於肯簽啲高學歷新人，希望佢有多啲機會！」、「睇過佢做《愛回家》，估唔到真人咁勁！」、「才貌雙全，支持Tracy！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18918224446ae97f9a8f91b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18918224446ae97f9a8f91b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15296971026ae97f9e077a1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15296971026ae97f9e077a1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_7563051466ae97fa1ce47d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_7563051466ae97fa1ce47d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5849192556ae97fa51baa4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5849192556ae97fa51baa4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_17779194546ae97fbacebc6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_17779194546ae97fbacebc6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2140309346ae97fc0bc19b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2140309346ae97fc0bc19b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20380693196ae97fc40c57a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20380693196ae97fc40c57a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:19.616158+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1073,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:00:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:20:05.040376+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:20:05.040376+00:00","content_hash":"5e670ec81f932e87fc68b48bd5bcd060cc3f7784ae3e7a7bf125308c9d05e56d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}